#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:23
msgid ""
"A worker-based kernel sweep can still belong in `test_kernel`: spawning workers alone does not "
"make the behavior under test a communication integration test. Inspect its test base and required"
" world size before running it."
msgstr "通过 worker 扫描参数的 kernel 测试仍可归入 `test_kernel`：启动 worker 本身不表示在测试通信集成。运行前应核对测试基类及要求的 world size。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:27
msgid "Running a focused test"
msgstr "运行针对性测试"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:29
msgid ""
"Run commands from the repository root with the dependencies from the [installation "
"guide](../user_guide/install.md). Select enough GPUs for the test's world size. The following "
"commands use one selected GPU for local tests:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录执行命令，并按[安装指南](../user_guide/install.md)准备依赖。根据测试 world size 选择足够的 GPU。以下命令使用一张指定 GPU 运行局部测试："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:40
msgid ""
"Use `python -m pytest --collect-only -q tests` to inspect collection without claiming execution. "
"`magi_attention.testing.parameterize` runs combinations inside each test method, so the pytest "
"item count is not the parameter count. Distributed tests use the library's process launcher; do "
"not also launch the same test with `torchrun` unless its entry point explicitly requires it."
msgstr ""
"使用 `python -m pytest --collect-only -q tests` "
"核对收集结果，不能据此声称已执行。`magi_attention.testing.parameterize` 在测试方法内部运行参数组合，因此 pytest item "
"数不等于参数组合数。分布式测试使用库内 launcher；除非入口明确要求，不要再用 `torchrun` 重复启动。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:46
msgid "Writing tests"
msgstr "编写测试"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:48
msgid ""
"Use `unittest.TestCase` and `unittest.main()` for ordinary CPU or single-GPU contracts. Use the "
"existing distributed test base and its `run_tests()` entry point when process-group or worker "
"lifecycle is required. Prefer the library's `parameterize`, environment-switching helpers, and "
"tensor assertions; keep exact equality distinct from numerical tolerance checks."
msgstr ""
"普通 CPU 或单 GPU 合同使用 `unittest.TestCase` 和 `unittest.main()`。需要进程组或 worker 生命周期时，复用现有分布式基类及 "
"`run_tests()` 入口。优先使用库内 `parameterize`、环境切换工具及 tensor 断言；区分精确相等与数值容差。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:54
msgid ""
"Use `magi_attention.utils.arch` for architecture conditions and the version helpers for "
"dependency gates. Do not skip GPU tests merely because CUDA is unavailable: a required runtime "
"failure should be visible. Keep architecture, version, rank-count, and explicit profiling "
"restrictions meaningful."
msgstr ""
"使用 `magi_attention.utils.arch` 判断架构，使用版本 helper 设置依赖门禁。不要仅因 CUDA 不可用而跳过 GPU "
"测试：所需运行环境故障应直接暴露。保留有意义的架构、版本、rank 数量及显式 profiling 限制。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:59
msgid ""
"Helpers shared by independent tests belong in `magi_attention.testing`; small case-specific "
"helpers stay in their test module. Do not import a test module from another test module. Keep "
"profiling workloads explicitly opt-in."
msgstr ""
"独立测试共享的 helper 放入 `magi_attention.testing`，仅服务当前用例的小 helper 留在测试模块内。测试模块之间不要互相 import。Profiling "
"工作负载必须显式启用。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:63
msgid "Python and C++ common backends"
msgstr "Python 与 C++ common backend"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:65
msgid ""
"Common container tests select implementation types inside each file. The `TestAttnRange`, "
"`TestAttnRanges`, rectangle, and protocol classes exercise Python; their `TestCpp*` subclasses "
"repeat the contracts with native types. These tests do not change the package's backend or reload"
" modules. `AttnMask` is Python-only. An unavailable native extension skips its direct "
"implementation tests."
msgstr ""
"Common 容器测试在各文件内部选择实现类型。`TestAttnRange`、`TestAttnRanges`、rectangle 和 protocol 类验证 Python 实现，其 "
"`TestCpp*` 子类使用原生类型重复验证合同。测试不切换包的 backend，也不 reload 模块。`AttnMask` 仅有 Python 实现。未安装原生扩展时跳过其直接实现测试。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:76
msgid ""
"The self-attention metadata and ground-truth dispatcher suites also check import-time routing. "
"Each file launches its own Python and C++ suites with `multiprocessing` spawn, setting "
"`MAGI_ATTENTION_CPP_BACKEND` before the child imports the package. It restores the parent's "
"environment immediately after startup and checks child failures and timeouts. There is no "
"recursive pytest wrapper or separate CI coverage mode. Keep backend setup local to these tests."
msgstr ""
"Self-attention 元数据及 ground-truth dispatcher suite 还验证 import 时的路由。每个文件通过 `multiprocessing` spawn "
"启动自己的 Python/C++ suite，在子进程 import 包之前设置 "
"`MAGI_ATTENTION_CPP_BACKEND`。启动后立即恢复父进程环境，并检查子进程失败和超时。不递归启动 pytest，也不设置额外的 CI coverage 模式。Backend"
" 设置保留在这些测试内部。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:83
msgid "Native kernel precompilation"
msgstr "原生 kernel 预编译"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:85
msgid ""
"Test classes that exercise native FFA variants declare `precompile_kernel_specs()`, ideally using"
" the same constants as their parameter matrix. Register their module in "
"`magi_attention.testing.precompile` when adding or moving a suite. Inspect the requested kernels "
"without compiling them:"
msgstr ""
"覆盖原生 FFA 变体的测试类声明 `precompile_kernel_specs()`，尽量与参数矩阵共用常量。新增或移动 suite 时，在 "
"`magi_attention.testing.precompile` 中登记模块。以下命令只查看 kernel 清单，不启动编译："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:94
msgid ""
"This registry feeds the CI prebuild as well as manual precompilation. Keep it synchronized with "
"the real test modules; do not include removed extension APIs."
msgstr "该注册表同时服务 CI prebuild 和手动预编译。应与真实测试模块同步，不包含已删除扩展接口。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:97
msgid "Kernel Backend"
msgstr "Kernel backend"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:99
msgid ""
"`test_pipeline.py` parameterizes over **all five kernel backends** (`ffa`, `sdpa`, `sdpa_ol`, "
"`fa4`, `cutedsl`). Each `attn_config` is tagged with the set of backends it applies to, so "
"incompatible (backend, config) pairs are automatically skipped."
msgstr ""
"`test_pipeline.py` 对 **五种 kernel backend**（`ffa`、`sdpa`、`sdpa_ol`、`fa4`、`cutedsl`）进行参数化。各 "
"`attn_config` 标注适用 backend，自动跳过不兼容的组合。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:101
msgid ""
"`ffa` / `fa4` / `cutedsl` -- run large-seqlen configs with fp16/bf16, using norm-based + "
"mismatch-based tolerance checks."
msgstr "`ffa` / `fa4` / `cutedsl`：使用 fp16/bf16 运行较长序列配置，以 norm 和 mismatch 容差判定。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:102
msgid "`sdpa` / `sdpa_ol` -- run small-seqlen configs with fp64, using exact (EPSILON) tolerance checks."
msgstr "`sdpa` / `sdpa_ol`：使用 fp64 运行较短序列配置，以精确的 EPSILON 容差判定。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:104
msgid "The backend is controlled by `MAGI_ATTENTION_KERNEL_BACKEND` (see below)."
msgstr "Backend 通过 `MAGI_ATTENTION_KERNEL_BACKEND` 控制，见下文。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:106
msgid "Test Case Filtering"
msgstr "测试用例筛选"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:108
msgid ""
"You can use environment variables to precisely control which parameterized test cases are "
"executed. All filter conditions use **AND** logic -- only test cases that satisfy all active "
"filters will run."
msgstr "可以使用环境变量精确筛选参数化测试用例。所有筛选条件按 **AND** 组合，只运行满足全部启用条件的用例。"

