#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:121
msgid ""
"For dict-typed parameters (e.g. `attn_config`), the filter matches against the `NAME` field "
"value. For `Enum` parameters (e.g. `backend`), it matches the canonical `.value` (`ffa`), the "
"member `.name` (`FFA`), and `str()` (`MagiAttentionKernelBackend.FFA`). For other types, the "
"`str()` representation is used."
msgstr ""
"字典类型参数（如 `attn_config`）匹配 `NAME` 字段。Enum 类型参数（如 `backend`）匹配规范 `.value`（`ffa`）、成员 "
"`.name`（`FFA`）以及 `str()`（`MagiAttentionKernelBackend.FFA`）。其他类型匹配 `str()` 表示。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:123
msgid ""
"**Note:** `overlap_config` and `random_type_mapping` have been moved from `@parameterize` "
"dimensions into `FlagCombGenerator` flags and are selected automatically by the heuristic "
"strategy. The env vars `MAGI_ATTENTION_TEST_OVERLAP_CONFIG` and "
"`MAGI_ATTENTION_TEST_RANDOM_TYPE_MAPPING` no longer take effect."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** `overlap_config` 和 `random_type_mapping` 已从 `@parameterize` 维度移入 `FlagCombGenerator` "
"flags，由启发式策略选择。`MAGI_ATTENTION_TEST_OVERLAP_CONFIG` 和 `MAGI_ATTENTION_TEST_RANDOM_TYPE_MAPPING` "
"不再生效。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:125
msgid ""
"**Note:** `num_heads`, `head_dims` and `dtype` are one `@parameterize` dimension (`shape_cfg`, 16"
" triples). The list is split by world-size parity: odd world sizes run 8 triples and even world "
"sizes run the other 8, so every triple runs on four world sizes. The "
"`MAGI_ATTENTION_TEST_NUM_HEADS` / `MAGI_ATTENTION_TEST_HEAD_DIM` / `MAGI_ATTENTION_TEST_DTYPE` "
"filters match the unpacked values and are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** `num_heads`、`head_dims` 和 `dtype` 合为一个 `@parameterize` 维度（`shape_cfg`，16 个三元组）。按 world-"
"size 奇偶分组：奇数 world size 运行 8 组，偶数运行另 8 组，每组在四个 world size 上运行。`MAGI_ATTENTION_TEST_NUM_HEADS` / "
"`MAGI_ATTENTION_TEST_HEAD_DIM` / `MAGI_ATTENTION_TEST_DTYPE` 仍匹配解包后的值。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/testing.md:127
msgid ""
"Values are **comma-separated fnmatch pattern lists**, supporting `*`, `?` and other glob "
"wildcards."
msgstr "值采用**逗号分隔的 fnmatch 模式列表**，支持 `*`、`?` 等通配符。"

